		(at 15 50 90)
		(descr "GT-502MGG-N bare-wire landing pads, single sided, no through holes. Five 2.0 x 3.0mm pads on 2.54mm pitch. 1 VCC, 2 GND, 3 RXD, 4 TXD, 5 PPS (labels are MODULE side: pad 3 carries the Pico's UART TX, so the module's RXD wire lands there - v1 printed T/R the other way round and hookup proved it wrong). Strain relief is the enclosure's job - no cable-tie holes, to save area.")
